  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to suggest a feature like interactions. These features would be personal player pick up and personal climbable. I'd say it would be allowed by those you have interactions available to aka friends or everyone and you can decide if your personal player is able to be picked up or even climbed on like some worlds allow. Instead of such a fun feature being restricted to just specific worlds, I feel like it would be more fun if we could turn the option on and off personally in any world just by it being added to the player. Of course throwing is not an option and is difficult if you tried in one of those worlds anyway. If climbing isn't exactly a feature for just players then just having the pick up option is enough to add more fun anywhere and everywhere.",
